OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA rather
OL,6,Fcloudy evening and night with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain spreading eastwards
OL,8,Facross all parts, which will be
OL,9,Flocally heavy at times. The rain will
OL,10,Fclear to the south by the morning. A
OL,11,Fbreezy and mild night for most.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FThe last of the overnight rain
OL,14,Fwill soon clear from southern areas,
OL,15,Fleaving a generally dry and bright
OL,16,Fday. Feeling fresher, although still
OL,17,Fpleasantly warm in the sunshine.
OL,18,FBreezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
